.mp4?t=1792608697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Slayer is built around constant growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest your Souls in a massive Skill Tree to unlock new mechanics and improve every aspect of your adventure. Gather materials to craft increasingly powerful items and obtain Divinities that can completely transform your gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also discover the Armory, where powerful equipment can be unlocked, upgraded, and equipped to further customize your Slayer and push your progress even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353300/extras/ddf3857f7c548bd47b0445123e3a4cfa.poster.avif?t=1792608697\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353300/extras/ddf3857f7c548bd47b0445123e3a4cfa.webm?t=1792608697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353300/extras/ddf3857f7c548bd47b0445123e3a4cfa.mp4?t=1792608697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Than an Idle Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Village offers a completely different way to experience Idle Slayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore freely, interact with characters, uncover secrets, and follow a story that continues to expand with new updates. The Village connects much of the game's content and turns the adventure into something far greater than simply collecting resources and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353300/extras/3ce466e1bed763dc381