"Start from nothing and grow into a legendary Slayer. Explore countless dimensions, collect souls, unlock powerful upgrades, craft powerful gear, defeat epic bosses, and enjoy a deep idle RPG with active and offline progression.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Hungarian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Vietnamese, Japanese, Dutch, Finnish, Swedish, Ukrainian, Danish, Norwegian, Armenian, Catalan, Malay, Indonesian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353300/header.jpg?t=1792608697", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353300/58c3be043bfe8200061d127adae3cef622f53ca0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792608697", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1353300/58c3be043bfe8200061d127adae3cef622f53ca0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792608697", "website": "https://idleslayer.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz +<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 MB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 (Monterey) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz + (Apple silicon or Intel)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 MB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>", "recomm